atEndCheck in scanRun
atEndCheck invokes compare.greaterOrEqualInt64
atEndCheck argument left Int64 offset copy
atEndCheck argument right Int64 sourceLength copy
atEndCheck result atEnd Bool
atEndCheck ownedBy none
atEndCheck cleanedBy none
atEndCheck borrows none
atEndCheck catch none

readByte is call
readByte in scanRun
readByte invokes string.byteAt
readByte argument text String source lend
readByte argument index Int64 offset copy
readByte result currentByte Byte
readByte ownedBy none
readByte cleanedBy none
readByte borrows none
readByte catch readByteError string.StringIndexError

